==Asturian==

===Etymology===
From {{der|ast|VL.|-}}, {{der|ast|LL.||iectāre}}, from {{der|ast|la|iactāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|iactō}}. Possibly through the intermediate of {{der|ast|es|echar}}; compare the inherited western Asturian {{m|ast|xeitar}}.

===Verb===
{{ast-verb-ar|ech}}

# to [[throw]]
# to [[throw out]], [[throw away]]
# to [[emit]]
# to [[get]], [[fetch]]
# to [[lean]]
# to [[put]]
# to [[take]] (time)
# to [[throw up]], [[raise]]
# to [[pour]]

